  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to IOM flash appeal &#x2013; Lebanon Humanitarian Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to IOM flash appeal as a response to the Lebanon Humanitarian Crisis through supporting small and medium-scale infrastructure programmes to ensure safe and equal access to services for the displaced populations; supporting local authorities and site management partners through mobile teams, ensuring coordinated and predictable delivery of services, protection and assistance, alongside site care and maintenance; distributing essential relief items such as mattresses, blankets, kitchen sets and solar lamps to IDPs and host communities to meet their immediate needs; and providing protection assistance to conflict-affected populations, including case management services and referrals, individual and community-based psychosocial support, and psychological first aid</narrative>
  </description>
